    <x:String x:Key="Settings.Game.MouseLock.Desc">防止滑鼠越過游戲窗口邊界，避免誤觸其他內容</x:String>
	<x:String x:Key="Settings.Game.MouseLock.Main.Title">總開關</x:String>
	<x:String x:Key="Settings.Game.MouseLock.Main.Desc">只有總開關開啟時，功能才會生效</x:String>
	<x:String x:Key="Settings.Game.MouseLock.Advance">高級</x:String>
	<x:String x:Key="Settings.Game.MouseLock.ForGdk.Title">對 GDK 版本生效</x:String>
	<x:String x:Key="Settings.Game.MouseLock.ForGdk.Desc">正常情況下，只有 UWP 版本才需要滑鼠鎖</x:String>
	<x:String x:Key="Settings.Game.MouseLock.Reserve.Title">舊版邏輯</x:String>
	<x:String x:Key="Settings.Game.MouseLock.Reserve.Desc">除非新版滑鼠鎖邏輯未能按照預期工作，否則你不應該打開這個開關</x:String>
	<x:String x:Key="Settings.Game.MouseLock.Reserve.Warn">舊版本滑鼠鎖邏輯更為粗暴，除了不必要的 CPU 消耗之外，還會導致其他應用或游戲自帶的滑鼠鎖定邏輯出現異常，&#10;且會導致解除鎖定的熱鍵工作異常。&#10;除非新版滑鼠鎖邏輯未能按照預期工作，否則你的確不應該打開這個開關！&#10;&#10;確認仍要打開嗎？</x:String>
	<x:String x:Key="Settings.Game.MouseLock.WindowTrimming.Title">四邊減去的像素數量</x:String>
	<x:String x:Key="Settings.Game.MouseLock.WindowTrimming.Desc">在窗口四邊減去少量像素，防止在游戲全屏或者在隱藏任務欄且游戲最大化時滑鼠誤觸任務欄</x:String>
	<x:String x:Key="Settings.Game.MouseLock.GetFrame.Title">UWP 窗口捕獲優先設定</x:String>
	<x:String x:Key="Settings.Game.MouseLock.GetFrame.Desc">設定 UWP 框架窗口捕獲策略。</x:String>
	<x:String x:Key="Settings.Game.MouseLock.GetFrame.Default">啟動時監視框架</x:String>
	<x:String x:Key="Settings.Game.MouseLock.GetFrame.Legacy">從游戲獲取框架</x:String>
	<x:String x:Key="Settings.Game.MouseLock.Hotkey.Title">熱鍵綁定</x:String>
	<x:String x:Key="Settings.Game.MouseLock.Hotkey.Desc">綁定臨時解除滑鼠鎖定的熱鍵</x:String>
	<x:String x:Key="Settings.Game.MouseLock.Hotkey.Capturing">捕獲中，按 Esc 取消</x:String>
    <x:String x:Key="Settings.Game.Group.Advanced">高級</x:String>
    <x:String x:Key="Settings.Game.LaunchCommand.Title">自定義命令</x:String>
    <x:String x:Key="Settings.Game.LaunchCommand.Desc">設定啟動前命令、啟動后命令與運行包裝器</x:String>
    <x:String x:Key="Settings.Game.LaunchCommand.Main.Title">總開關</x:String>
    <x:String x:Key="Settings.Game.LaunchCommand.Main.Desc">只有總開關開啟時，下方的自定義命令才會生效</x:String>
    <x:String x:Key="Settings.Game.LaunchCommand.Group.Hooks">命令</x:String>
    <x:String x:Key="Settings.Game.LaunchCommand.Pre.Title">啟動前命令</x:String>
    <x:String x:Key="Settings.Game.LaunchCommand.Pre.Desc">在游戲進程啟動之前執行的命令</x:String>
    <x:String x:Key="Settings.Game.LaunchCommand.Pre.Watermark">例如：taskkill /IM SomeApp.exe</x:String>
    <x:String x:Key="Settings.Game.LaunchCommand.Post.Title">啟動后命令</x:String>
    <x:String x:Key="Settings.Game.LaunchCommand.Post.Desc">在游戲進程退出之后執行的命令</x:String>
    <x:String x:Key="Settings.Game.LaunchCommand.Post.Watermark">例如：shutdown /s /t 60</x:String>
    <x:String x:Key="Settings.Game.LaunchCommand.Group.Wrapper">運行包裝器</x:String>
    <x:String x:Key="Settings.Game.LaunchCommand.Wrapper.Title">包裝器命令</x:String>
    <x:String x:Key="Settings.Game.LaunchCommand.Wrapper.Desc">使用 %command% 代表原始的游戲啟動命令，留空則不使用包裝器</x:String>
    <x:String x:Key="Settings.Game.LaunchCommand.Wrapper.Watermark">例如：gamemoderun %command%</x:String>
    <x:String x:Key="Settings.Game.LaunchCommand.Wrapper.Unsupported.Title">包裝器在 Windows 上不可用</x:String>
    <x:String x:Key="Settings.Game.LaunchCommand.Wrapper.Unsupported.Desc">Windows 的游戲通過 UWP/GDK 包激活啟動，沒有可供包裝的進程命令行。啟動前與啟動后命令仍然可用。</x:String>
    <x:String x:Key="Settings.Game.LaunchCommand.Group.Behavior">執行行為</x:String>
